[gd_resource type="Resource" format=3]

[resource]
metadata/text = "catsSaga() — Third-party art and ambient recordings\n\nForest and combat artwork — Pixel-Boy, Ninja Adventure — CC0\nhttps://pixel-boy.itch.io/ninja-adventure-asset-pack\nUnchanged frames from the January 2022 distribution:\nhttps://github.com/clear-code-projects/Zelda/tree/5f4c57bfbb162d2f19b287a5c24816d93c17e08d\nSources and hashes: assets/overhaul_human/provenance.json\n\nIcons made by Lorc — CC BY 3.0\nPaw-print and echo-ripples, game-icons.net\nhttps://game-icons.net/1x1/lorc/paw-print.html\nhttps://game-icons.net/1x1/lorc/echo-ripples.html\nhttps://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/\nDisplayed as tinted white-ink masks and scaled ripples/footprints.\n\nWonderland artwork — Pixel-Boy, Ninja Adventure — CC0\nhttps://pixel-boy.itch.io/ninja-adventure-asset-pack\nhttps://github.com/pixel-boy/NinjaAdventure\nCC0 art distribution/notice:\nhttps://github.com/clear-code-projects/Zelda/tree/5f4c57bfbb162d2f19b287a5c24816d93c17e08d\nhttps://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\nNo music from this pack is used.\n\nRetained Wonderland architecture, furniture, flowers and props — Kenney Vleugels / Kenney; Roguelike RPG pack also credits Lynn Evers — CC0.\nhttps://kenney.nl/assets/roguelike-rpg-pack\nhttps://kenney.nl/assets/roguelike-interior-pack\nhttps://kenney.nl/assets/roguelike-caves-dungeons\nhttps://kenney.nl/assets/1-bit-pack\n\nAmbient recordings (all unchanged source Ogg files):\n\nWind in the trees — laurent — CC BY (archive does not specify version)\nhttps://freesound.org/people/laurent/sounds/16995/\nDry grass in wind — felix.blume — CC0\nhttps://freesound.org/people/felix.blume/sounds/146436/\nThe archive's ComboWind.ogg combines these two credited recordings.\n\nBirdsong — HerbertBoland — CC BY (version unspecified)\nhttps://freesound.org/people/HerbertBoland/sounds/28312/\nRobin — reinsamba — CC BY (version unspecified)\nhttps://freesound.org/people/reinsamba/sounds/32479/\nBluejay — UncleSigmund — CC0\nhttps://freesound.org/people/UncleSigmund/sounds/42382/\n\nNightime / Crickets at Night — Mike Koenig — CC BY 3.0\nhttps://soundbible.com/951-Nightime.html\nhttps://soundbible.com/365-Crickets-At-Night.html\nSpooky Water Drops — Mike Koenig — CC BY 3.0\nhttps://soundbible.com/380-Spooky-Water-Drops.html\n\nDripping Water mod drips A/B — kddekadenz — CC0\nhttps://minetest.net/forum/viewtopic.php?id=1688\nLake Waves 2 — Benboncan — CC BY (version unspecified)\nhttps://freesound.org/people/Benboncan/sounds/67884/\nSmall waterfall — volivieri — CC BY (version unspecified)\nhttps://freesound.org/people/volivieri/sounds/38390/\n\nAudio provenance and per-file license notice:\nhttps://github.com/Neuromancer56/MinetestAmbience/tree/4b78eb558617662c2c47f029679692780fcc46cf/ambience/sounds\nOnly the permissively licensed sounds credited here are included; no noncommercial sounds or archive music are used.\nPlayback applies gain/fades, layering, slight pitch changes and cave reverb. No audio was generated or re-exported.\n\nFull source hashes, archive evidence, licensing/access limitations and original notices are in the project repository:\ndocs/wonderland-polish-credits.md\nassets/wonderland_human/polish-provenance.json\n\nNo generative image or audio model was used in this update.\n\nWonderland environmental reconstruction — LPC Revised\nLanea Zimmerman (Sharm), Eliza Wyatt (DeathsDarling), BlueCarrot16, Hyptosis\nOGA-BY 3.0\nhttps://github.com/ElizaWy/LPC/tree/f07f7f5892e67c932c68f70bb04472f2c64e46bc\nhttps://opengameart.org/content/oga-by-30-faq\nOriginal hand-drawn trees, mushrooms, flowers, furniture, beds, rugs, shingles, siding, wallpaper, floors and garden fences. Atlas selection, placement, scaling, shader tint and animation only; source PNGs unchanged.\nPer-sheet artists and source links: assets/wonderland_human/rebuild/*Credits.txt and docs/wonderland-environment-rebuild-credits.md\n\nGlass clink — Mito551 — CC BY-SA 3.0\nhttps://github.com/luanti-org/minetest_game/tree/0.4.17\nhttps://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/\nOriginal default_glass_footstep.ogg, byte-identical to the 2018 release. Used near tea tables with gain/pitch adjustment. Original notices retained.\n\nRegion transition typography: DejaVu Serif Condensed, DejaVu contributors / Bitstream Vera license. Existing font and license retained in assets/ui/fonts/.\n"
